OL,3,GNEWSAM&S confirms permanent closure of
OL,4,Afire-damaged store
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarks and Spencer (M&S) has confirmed
OL,7,Fit will not reopen its store in
OL,8,FThurmaston after a major fire.
OL,10,FMuch of Thurmaston Shopping Centre in
OL,11,FBarkby Thorpe Lane was demolished after
OL,12,Fthe fire, which started at about 04:00
OL,13,FBST on 20 June.
OL,15,FLaura Arnold, regional manager at M&S,
OL,16,Fconfirmed the store would close after
OL,17,Fthe company assessed the extent of the
OL,18,Fdamage.
OL,20,FLeicestershire Police said three
OL,21,F13-year-old boys, who were arrested on
OL,22,Fsuspicion of arson, remained on bail.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
